{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/21fe5f605f1b019bf299435d3d49a642.avif?t=1763021412\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help cats get to sleep in this adorable game, with novel mechanics based on nonograms and sliding puzzles. Nekograms is easy to learn but does get challenging!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/aa20dfe13966a93df44040b6ce7632fd.webp?t=1763021412\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cats only sleep on cushions. Complete a level by helping all cats get to sleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/b7cd1d1b04d959a80f9a9f0df5dde084.poster.avif?t=1763021412\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/b7cd1d1b04d959a80f9a9f0df5dde084.webm?t=1763021412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/b7cd1d1b04d959a80f9a9f0df5dde084.mp4?t=1763021412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/5b148442477651f49682b6a6806bf8d4.webp?t=1763021412\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn stars by completing levels in the fewest number of moves. Achieve 3 stars in every level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/55e27e0b1822c7b015de07909e231e35.poster.avif?t=1763021412\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/55e27e0b1822c7b015de07909e231e35.webm?t=1763021412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/55e27e0b1822c7b015de07909e231e35.mp4?t=1763021412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/99ae1b4973bc140c4bad788aaba59b9c.webp?t=1763021412\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the game to unlock Endless Mode and ascend through different states of cat consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/566edbc642e8e399cf28b4ae94f1416b.poster.avif?t=1763021412\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/566edbc642e8e399cf28b4ae94f1416b.webm?t=1763021412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/566edbc642e8e399cf28b4ae94f1416b.mp4?t=1763021412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478120/extras/e69e4acd62a86c04a7c3d31f5cd15442.webp?t=1763021412\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original puzzle mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"b